Obsolete on ROS Jazzy / MoveIt Pro 10.x: this package provides only the MoveIt
controller allocator (epick_gripper_controller_allocator), which plugs into the
MoveIt controller-manager layer that main removed (commit 4df744f81a). It depends
on the deleted moveit_pro_base/controller_manager/controller_manager.hpp and the
moveit_pro::base::controller_manager::MoveItControllerHandle type. Nothing depends
on this package and the picknik_009_ur5e config does not reference it; the gripper
is driven via ros2_control (epick_driver + epick_controllers). Excluded from the
build until/unless MoveIt Pro reintroduces a controller-allocator mechanism.
